PN,36302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F363A1790948895
OL,3,C'Wrongdoing' at Man City should lead
OL,4,Cto 'appropriate consequences', says No
OL,5,C10
OL,7,FConservative shadow sport minister
OL,8,FLouie French had accused Mr Burnham of
OL,9,F"publicly backing the owners" amid a
OL,10,Fprobe into the club's funding over
OL,11,Frecent years, describing his comments
OL,12,Fas "frankly extraordinary".
OL,14,FBut Oasis's Liam Gallagher, a Man City
OL,15,Ffan, appeared to welcome Mr Burnham's
OL,16,Fintervention on Wednesday, writing on
OL,17,FX: "There's only 1 ANDY BURNHAM."
OL,26,@qD@AOUqD@]O]tD@DOUtD@ZO]yD@DOUyD@aO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/11
