PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F363A1790948895
OL,3,C'Wrongdoing' at Man City should lead
OL,4,Cto 'appropriate consequences', says No
OL,5,C10
OL,7,FCity were found guilty of most of the
OL,8,F115 charges relating to breaches of
OL,9,FPremier League financial rules between
OL,10,F2009 and 2018.
OL,12,FThe Premier League said an independent
OL,13,Fcommission found City arranged "sham"
OL,14,Fcommercial deals to inflate its
OL,15,Frevenue by more than #830 million.
OL,17,FThe club have until tomorrow to launch
OL,18,Fan appeal.
OL,26,@uD@`OUuD@eO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,364,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F363A1790948895
OL,3,C'Wrongdoing' at Man City should lead
OL,4,Cto 'appropriate consequences', says No
OL,5,C10
OL,7,FIt's understood, at the heart of that
OL,8,Fappeal, will be evidence that the Abu
OL,9,FDhabi government provided sponsorship
OL,10,Ffunding and not owner Sheikh Mansour.
OL,12,FMr Burnham told 5 News earlier this
OL,13,Fweek that "it's only right that
OL,14,FManchester City and Manchester City
OL,15,Fsupporters have that opportunity to
OL,16,Fcontinue to contest the situation, if
OL,17,Fthey don't think it's fair".
OL,19,FHe said the side, majority owned by
OL,20,FSheikh Mansour bin Zayed Al Nahyan,
OL,21,Ffaced "very serious charges".
OL,26,@uD@KOUyD@[O]}D@GOU}D@\O]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,364,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F363A1790948895
OL,3,C'Wrongdoing' at Man City should lead
OL,4,Cto 'appropriate consequences', says No
OL,5,C10
OL,7,FSpeaking to the BBC, the Prime
OL,8,FMinister and former mayor of Greater
OL,9,FManchester said he was "not getting
OL,10,Fdirectly involved in the process".
OL,12,FAsked if he was worried about the
OL,13,Fcurrent owners selling the club, he
OL,14,Fsaid: "I would be really concerned to
OL,15,Flose them.
OL,17,F"They've been such a huge partner in
OL,18,Fthe building of modern Manchester.
OL,19,FObviously, the building of Manchester
OL,20,FCity into the global force that it is."
OL,26,@qD@XOUrD@aO]vD@GOUyD@AOU|D@gO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,364,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F363A1790948895
OL,3,C'Wrongdoing' at Man City should lead
OL,4,Cto 'appropriate consequences', says No
OL,5,C10
OL,7,FAsked also if his dealings with the
OL,8,Fclub would stand up to scrutiny, Mr
OL,9,FBurnham said: "I do actually thank the
OL,10,FCity Football Group and the wider
OL,11,Fownership for the money that they
OL,12,Fdidn't just put into the Etihad and
OL,13,Fthe campus around it but also into the
OL,14,Fcity ` but yes, of course."
OL,16,FA No 10 spokesperson on Thursday said:
OL,17,F"As the Prime Minister made clear, the
OL,18,Finitial judgment is serious and there
OL,19,Fcan't be any suggestion that anyone is
OL,20,Fabove the rules.
OL,26,@qD@OOUvD@[O]yD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,364,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F363A1790948895
OL,3,C'Wrongdoing' at Man City should lead
OL,4,Cto 'appropriate consequences', says No
OL,5,C10
OL,7,F"He also stressed that it is an
OL,8,Fongoing independent process. It is
OL,9,Fessential that it is allowed to run
OL,10,Fits course and the outcome respected.
OL,12,F"Wherever wrongdoing is established,
OL,13,Fthose responsible should face the
OL,14,Fappropriate consequences."
OL,16,FMr French earlier said: "Andy
OL,17,FBurnham's intervention in support of
OL,18,FManchester City's owners is frankly
OL,19,Fextraordinary.
OL,26,@oD@AOUvD@ZO]xD@YOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,364,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F363A1790948895
OL,3,C'Wrongdoing' at Man City should lead
OL,4,Cto 'appropriate consequences', says No
OL,5,C10
OL,7,F"The club face unprecedented
OL,8,Fallegations and fans are horrified by
OL,9,Fwhat they are reading in the papers,
OL,10,Fyet Burnham is publicly backing the
OL,11,Fowners even as the investigation
OL,12,Fcontinues.
OL,14,F"Fans will rightly ask whether
OL,15,Fpolitical pressure is being applied
OL,16,Fhere and how it relates to the owners'
OL,17,Fwell-reported investments in
OL,18,FManchester.
OL,26,@oD@AOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/11
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBNW Eng SportCReg RadioFRewind
FL,364,390,250,120,000,100
PN,36309
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F363A1790948895
OL,3,C'Wrongdoing' at Man City should lead
OL,4,Cto 'appropriate consequences', says No
OL,5,C10
OL,7,F"Football must be governed
OL,8,Findependently, with the rules applying
OL,9,Fequally to everyone. Fans deserve
OL,10,Fconfidence that no club or owner is
OL,11,Fabove those rules.
OL,13,F"Burnham's comments are therefore
OL,14,Fcompletely out of touch with fans and
OL,15,Fthe wider public. The Government must
OL,16,Fkeep politics out of football and
OL,17,Fensure the Premier League's
OL,18,Findependent commission can do its job
OL,19,Ffree of outside influence."
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOU{D@[O]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/11
