OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F363A1790948895
OL,3,C'Wrongdoing' at Man City should lead
OL,4,Cto 'appropriate consequences', says No
OL,5,C10
OL,7,FIn a letter, the Hackney South and
OL,8,FShoreditch MP pointed to part of the
OL,9,FPremier League's decision, that City
OL,10,F"utilised devices to disguise the true
OL,11,Fextent of certain club liabilities".
OL,13,FShe asked HMRC permanent secretary JP
OL,14,FMarks whether his organisation was
OL,15,F"aware of these findings (pending
OL,16,Fappeal)" and whether it had requested
OL,17,Fan unredacted version of the decision.
OL,26,@rD@AOUsD@cO]wD@AOUxD@HO]
